  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Working hard, but still going nowhere?",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 2.925
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Two brothers had one horse and one cart.",
      "start": 3.065,
      "end": 5.84
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "One put the horse behind the cart. Pushing was a struggle.",
      "start": 5.98,
      "end": 9.73
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "His brother moved the horse to the front.",
      "start": 9.87,
      "end": 12.395
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Same horse. Same cart. A much easier journey.",
      "start": 12.535,
      "end": 16.285
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Money can work the same way.",
      "start": 16.425,
      "end": 18.625
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Buy first, and tomorrow's income pays for yesterday's purchase.",
      "start": 18.765,
      "end": 23.065
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Where you can, change the order. Earn, save, then buy.",
      "start": 23.205,
      "end": 26.905
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Imagine making car payments into savings before buying your next car.",
      "start": 27.045,
      "end": 31.845
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Then keep saving for its replacement.",
      "start": 31.985,
      "end": 34.46
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Your payments build savings, instead of repaying a loan with interest.",
      "start": 34.6,
      "end": 39.0
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Put the horse first. Let's fix money.",
      "start": 39.14,
      "end": 41.915
    }
  ],
